{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他答不上自尊是否非得拒绝怀念，就不急着选边，想念过去也不急着抽身，更不拿它要求现在。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I67\", \"I69\", \"I70\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I65\", \"I66\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"从前他被接纳，有亲近和理解，能安心做自己，那样的生活让他相信生活、善待别人，也敢坚持看重的事。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I71\", \"I72\", \"I73\", \"I74\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I33\", \"I35\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他还想守住从前的坦然，如今坚持自己时不必把怀念推开，也不因想念就嫌现在不好。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I75\", \"I76\", \"I78\", \"I79\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I63\", \"I64\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他心里暂时安静下来，感激那段生活，也为如今仍能坚持而高兴，那些珍贵的东西已是他的一部分。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I68\", \"I77\", \"I80\", \"I81\", \"I82\"],\n      \"cite\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ca0c927d-5081-4b07-8ef3-ff08ba1936e0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261101T044631155674Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-01T04:48:21.067198+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ed76ee42ac9e3a34d7d6b0a3bbc06ceedcb9e6b2a772e8ae47af50c1833b03a2", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_